# RoyalRushRoomBoss1 (18121, a Four Sepulchers room boss, its shipped skills), every draw 0. It
# appears wanting its first self debuff (4694-1) on itself, weight 1000000, which the first hit's
# desire selection casts. Once its AI took up the attack on the character, the character is its
# top desire target, and a hit by it wants its first range magic (4589) and its parent's first
# physical special (4572) on the character, each weight 1000000, beside the Warrior's hate.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.RoyalRushRoomBossBasic.RoyalRushRoomBossBasic
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.RoyalRushRoomBossBasic.RoyalRushRoomBoss1
npc boss 18121 Monster 40 0 0 skill PHYSICAL_SPECIAL1 4572 9 skill RANGE_DD_MAGIC1 4589 9 skill SELF_DEBUFF1 4694 1

hit boss 22
  S MagicSkillUse caster=boss target=boss skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  desires boss attack(player)=275 cast(boss,4694,move)=1000000
advance 3s
  desires boss attack(player)=275
tick
  desires boss attack(player)=275
hit boss 22
  desires boss attack(player)=550 cast(player,4589,move)=1000000 cast(player,4572,move)=1000000
